{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15727","headline":"酬李端校书见赠 · 司空曙","name":"酬李端校书见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿槐垂穗乳乌飞，忽忆山中独未归。\n青镜流年看发变，白云芳草与心违。\n乍逢酒客春游惯，久别林僧夜坐稀。\n昨日闻君到城阙，莫将簪弁胜荷衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}